  "note": "UX-463's T5, axis D. shared-base-wide with mod2 exiting non-zero after its work ran, so the capture is of a build that failed rather than one that was stopped. mod2's two seconds are load-bearing: Plane 1's log carries second-resolution timestamps, so a sub-second task reads as ~1ms and `failed-task-time` - which needs failed_task_us above zero - never fires. Measured at 0.3s: failed_task_count 1, failed_task_us 0."
